  "readmeFile": "README.md",
  "releaseNotes": "1.3.0: content-aware compression pipeline. New CavemanContentRouter detects content type (JSON array, code, log, diff, HTML, plain text) and routes to the best compressor. New CavemanJsonCrusher compresses JSON arrays via lossless CSV/markdown-table compaction or lossy BM25 row-drop (with CCR reversibility markers). New CavemanCacheAligner detects volatile tokens (UUIDs, ISO-8601 timestamps, JWTs, hex hashes) that break LLM KV-cache reuse. New CavemanCcrStore caches dropped rows for on-demand retrieval. ICompressionService gains CompressContentAsync() (content-type-aware, backward-compatible default implementation). New CavemanContentRouterBuilder for fluent DI composition. All changes are fully additive; existing API unchanged.",
